=== PR DESCRIPTION ===
Currently when `Calculate` calls `merge` it is not passing a deep copy of `spec.BundleDeploymentOptions`, which contains pointers. This results in the `merge` incorrectly modifying the `base` `BundleDeploymentOptions`. 

This PR will address an issue where targetCustomizations by one cluster override the base. i.e. helm values for a specific target apply to all targets that don't have a helm values override

Signed-off-by: Matthew DeVenny <matt@boxboat.com>

=== COMMIT SUBJECTS ===
  - Use deep copy in merge function to ensure that the spec.BundleDeploymentOptions aren't incorrectly modified by merging

